OL,5,G1025 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FInterceptors hunt for thieves who
OL,7,     Fhad it away with ten grand's worth
OL,8,     Fof luxury jackets. When one of the
OL,9,     Fcoat-snatchers won't come quietly,
OL,10,     Fpolice dog Peggy needs to
OL,11,     Fintervene.
